# Git: always push to `agentic-wallet`

- Default git branch for this project is `agentic-wallet`. Create/switch work here, not `main`.
- After creating a commit the user requested, also run `git push origin agentic-wallet` (or `git push -u origin agentic-wallet` if upstream is unset) unless they explicitly say not to push.
- Never force-push. Never skip hooks. Never amend unless the user asks and amend safety rules are met.
- Never push secrets: `.env`, `.env.local`, keystores, `credentials.json`, `wallet.json`, `.baw/`, or hardcoded keys.
- The VPS deploys from `agentic-wallet` (`git pull` on that branch). A local-only commit is not deployed.

```bash
# ✅ after a requested commit
git push origin agentic-wallet

# ❌ never
git push --force
git push origin main
```
